[31.672631, "o", "oge-agent (Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B)\r\ntest(ComStub): verify SVC-COMSTUB-007 with a requirement-tagged unit test\r\nRequirement SVC-COMSTUB-007: Svc::ComStub shall emit exactly one Fw::Success::SUCCESS via comStatusOut after a driver reconnection following a previous failure to indicate recovery\r\nNew test(s): Sync.RecoveryAfterFailure\r\nAI-Assisted: yes. Test code generated by Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B through the onprem-genai-embedded agent (1 attempt(s)); built and run automatically. Requires human review before merge.\r\n Svc/ComStub/test/ut/ComStubTestMain.cpp |  6 ++++++\r\n Svc/ComStub/test/ut/ComStubTester.cpp   | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\r\n Svc/ComStub/test/ut/ComStubTester.hpp   |  4 ++++\r\n 3 files changed, 43 insertions(+)\r\n"]
